WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,020
The God of Creation returns to his original position, advancing and retreating together with the broken ones

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:11,060
Make a standard but not a copy

3
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,060
Your physique is right here

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,060
This won't last a few days

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,060
Think about it carefully

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,060
If you don't come out you will die

7
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,060
If you die, your grandfather's troubles will be in vain.

8
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,250
My grandfather's last wish

9
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,250
Just won't let me out

10
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,250
It has nothing to do with me whether you can leave or not.

11
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,250
But we must never go to that Wang Daxian again.

12
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:26,250
He is a pure liar

13
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:28,250
The village chief who took you there

14
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:29,250
I'm also in the same group as him

15
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,250
Don't want me to leave either

16
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:32,250
But if I really die

17
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,280
Then grandpa’s hard work has been wasted, isn’t it?

18
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:38,300
You introduced me to fifteen fellow countrymen

19
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,300
Only the little brat stood up

20
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,300
Others bought some blessings

21
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,300
You take this money

22
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,300
Okay, there are three more in the afternoon

23
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,300
Pull up the team in front of the door

24
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,300
There are too few people and they don’t believe it

25
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,770
I've waited in line for so long before

26
00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:52,770
It's also fake
